		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνῑσ-άεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνῖσα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full of the
				steam of burnt sacrifice</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶμα</span>”
