					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					7.80
				</span></i>
			: dat.
				contr.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνισᾶντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>I.</u>
					4(3).66
				</span></i>
			.</div>
